{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026xJoxtPI1pi1793674114.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價連跌兩天。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價，報6.715，較上個交易日下調4點子。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價，早段於6.66水平上落。另外人民銀行開展6,210億元人民幣，隔夜逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨回籠3,320億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:03.389403+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":128,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T02:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T17:38:20.443607+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T03:39:39.280373+00:00","content_hash":"98fb40375ba20feabcc8803c9eaa8008b2c03c827ab4fd36b7ec37cc363d4884","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T03:44:03.389403+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}